'''Angelic Slug''' (なめ（天使）, ''Name (Tenshi)'') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Angelic Slug
|image = E 343.png
|appearance = [[Sliming to Victory]]<br>
[[Citadel#Angel|Angel Citadel]]<br>
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 16|Infernal Tower - Floor 16]]
|money drop = 800¢ - 3,160¢
}}

==Enemy==
On top of having superior stats compared to [[Red Slug]] and [[Black Slug]], it also has higher range, making it a decent threat if well-protected.

==Strategy==
Luckily, it is the slowest of the three Slugs, allowing you to defeat its support before it gets to you. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] is perfect for stalling it, and from there simply stack mid-ranged cats to kill it.

